[gd_scene format=3]

; The one variable: `picker_shape`, at 1 (HSV wheel), 2 (VHS circle), 3 (OKHSL circle),
; 5 (OK HS rectangle), 6 (OK HL rectangle) and 0 (HSV rectangle) beside them. Each shape draws
; Godot's canvas shader (color_picker_shape.cpp:38-137), its cursors and its slider. Every other
; colour picker golden draws the HSV rectangle or no shape, so none shows these.

